Dialogue: 0,0:04:52.62,0:04:54.49,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,她對於自己\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs17}{\b0}{\c&HFFFFFF&}{\3c&H2F2F2F&}{\4c&H000000&}{\shad1}She's a bit sensitive
