Dialogue: 0,0:06:10.03,0:06:12.87,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好吧  還真有點諷刺\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs17}{\b0}{\c&HFFFFFF&}{\3c&H2F2F2F&}{\4c&H000000&}{\shad1}Okay, that's kind of ironic.
