Dialogue: 0,0:06:23.35,0:06:26.15,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你會愛上你的小房間\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs17}{\b0}{\c&HFFFFFF&}{\3c&H2F2F2F&}{\4c&H000000&}{\shad1}You are going to love your little room.
