Dialogue: 0,0:06:42.43,0:06:44.36,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,所以說我是哈利·波特\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs17}{\b0}{\c&HFFFFFF&}{\3c&H2F2F2F&}{\4c&H000000&}{\shad1}So I'm Harry Potter.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:44.37,0:06:45.93,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,沒錯\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs17}{\b0}{\c&HFFFFFF&}{\3c&H2F2F2F&}{\4c&H000000&}{\shad1}Exactly.
