Dialogue: 0,0:06:53.38,0:06:56.21,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,別告訴任何人你在這裏  好嗎\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs17}{\b0}{\c&HFFFFFF&}{\3c&H2F2F2F&}{\4c&H000000&}{\shad1}A-And don't tell anyone you're here, okay?
