Dialogue: 0,0:07:03.42,0:07:05.09,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,也是\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs17}{\b0}{\c&HFFFFFF&}{\3c&H2F2F2F&}{\4c&H000000&}{\shad1}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:05.09,0:07:06.52,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,謝謝\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs17}{\b0}{\c&HFFFFFF&}{\3c&H2F2F2F&}{\4c&H000000&}{\shad1}Thanks.
