Dialogue: 0,0:07:27.14,0:07:28.81,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,太噁心了  停下\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs17}{\b0}{\c&HFFFFFF&}{\3c&H2F2F2F&}{\4c&H000000&}{\shad1}That's disgusting! Stop it!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:28.81,0:07:31.28,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,天哪  你幹什麼呢\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs17}{\b0}{\c&HFFFFFF&}{\3c&H2F2F2F&}{\4c&H000000&}{\shad1}Oh, my God, what are you doing?
