Dialogue: 0,1:04:24.02,1:04:26.52,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,她肯定有自己的原因\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs17}{\b0}{\c&HFFFFFF&}{\3c&H2F2F2F&}{\4c&H000000&}{\shad1}Oh, I'm sure she has her reasons.
