Dialogue: 0,1:04:32.53,1:04:34.80,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,她有趣\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs17}{\b0}{\c&HFFFFFF&}{\3c&H2F2F2F&}{\4c&H000000&}{\shad1}Someone who's funny.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:36.07,1:04:38.80,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,喜歡笑\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs17}{\b0}{\c&HFFFFFF&}{\3c&H2F2F2F&}{\4c&H000000&}{\shad1}Likes to laugh.
