Dialogue: 0,1:04:46.98,1:04:49.05,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,超級可愛\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs17}{\b0}{\c&HFFFFFF&}{\3c&H2F2F2F&}{\4c&H000000&}{\shad1}Who's amazingly cute.
