Dialogue: 0,1:04:55.49,1:04:57.32,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我覺得車沒問題了\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs17}{\b0}{\c&HFFFFFF&}{\3c&H2F2F2F&}{\4c&H000000&}{\shad1}I think that should do it.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:57.32,1:04:59.06,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你想騎上去試試嗎\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs17}{\b0}{\c&HFFFFFF&}{\3c&H2F2F2F&}{\4c&H000000&}{\shad1}You wanna try and start her up?
