Dialogue: 0,1:05:10.70,1:05:12.54,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你修好了\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs17}{\b0}{\c&HFFFFFF&}{\3c&H2F2F2F&}{\4c&H000000&}{\shad1}You did it!
Dialogue: 0,1:05:12.54,1:05:15.41,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我們修好了  我們成功了\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs17}{\b0}{\c&HFFFFFF&}{\3c&H2F2F2F&}{\4c&H000000&}{\shad1}We did it. We totally did it.
