Dialogue: 0,1:05:28.95,1:05:30.75,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你在這兒呢\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs17}{\b0}{\c&HFFFFFF&}{\3c&H2F2F2F&}{\4c&H000000&}{\shad1}There you are!
Dialogue: 0,1:05:30.76,1:05:33.29,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你現在應該和豪斯頓家族會面\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs17}{\b0}{\c&HFFFFFF&}{\3c&H2F2F2F&}{\4c&H000000&}{\shad1}You're supposed to be meeting with the Halstons right now.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:33.29,1:05:35.56,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,沒錯\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs17}{\b0}{\c&HFFFFFF&}{\3c&H2F2F2F&}{\4c&H000000&}{\shad1}Uh? Oh, yeah.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:35.56,1:05:37.63,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我忘記時間了\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs17}{\b0}{\c&HFFFFFF&}{\3c&H2F2F2F&}{\4c&H000000&}{\shad1}Um, I lost track of time.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:37.63,1:05:39.20,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,能等我一分鐘嗎\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs17}{\b0}{\c&HFFFFFF&}{\3c&H2F2F2F&}{\4c&H000000&}{\shad1}Can you give me one minute?
Dialogue: 0,1:05:39.20,1:05:40.53,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你需要一分鐘啊\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs17}{\b0}{\c&HFFFFFF&}{\3c&H2F2F2F&}{\4c&H000000&}{\shad1}Oh, you need a minute?
Dialogue: 0,1:05:40.53,1:05:41.97,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,當然可以  當然  慢慢\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs17}{\b0}{\c&HFFFFFF&}{\3c&H2F2F2F&}{\4c&H000000&}{\shad1}By all means, yeah, take all the--
Dialogue: 0,1:05:41.97,1:05:43.27,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不行  一分鐘也不行\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs17}{\b0}{\c&HFFFFFF&}{\3c&H2F2F2F&}{\4c&H000000&}{\shad1}No, you can't have a minute!
Dialogue: 0,1:05:44.74,1:05:47.34,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我們不能讓金主等著  裏德\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs17}{\b0}{\c&HFFFFFF&}{\3c&H2F2F2F&}{\4c&H000000&}{\shad1}We don't keep the big money waiting, Reed.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:52.41,1:05:55.28,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我過會兒給你打電話\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs17}{\b0}{\c&HFFFFFF&}{\3c&H2F2F2F&}{\4c&H000000&}{\shad1}I'll call you later.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:55.28,1:05:57.18,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,快走  快走\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs17}{\b0}{\c&HFFFFFF&}{\3c&H2F2F2F&}{\4c&H000000&}{\shad1}Let's go. Let's go.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:00.12,1:06:02.99,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,弗雷迪\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs17}{\b0}{\c&HFFFFFF&}{\3c&H2F2F2F&}{\4c&H000000&}{\shad1}Freddie?
Dialogue: 0,1:06:02.99,1:06:05.79,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那個  豪斯頓家族\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs17}{\b0}{\c&HFFFFFF&}{\3c&H2F2F2F&}{\4c&H000000&}{\shad1}The-- The Halstons...
Dialogue: 0,1:06:05.79,1:06:08.63,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哈珀也會來嗎\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs17}{\b0}{\c&HFFFFFF&}{\3c&H2F2F2F&}{\4c&H000000&}{\shad1}Um, will Harper be there?
Dialogue: 0,1:06:08.63,1:06:10.89,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,會  她要飛過來  給裏德一個驚喜\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs17}{\b0}{\c&HFFFFFF&}{\3c&H2F2F2F&}{\4c&H000000&}{\shad1}Yes, she's flying out to surprise Reed.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:10.90,1:06:13.13,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我安排的\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs17}{\b0}{\c&HFFFFFF&}{\3c&H2F2F2F&}{\4c&H000000&}{\shad1}I arranged it.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:13.13,1:06:15.30,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,所以他們  他們在一起了\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs17}{\b0}{\c&HFFFFFF&}{\3c&H2F2F2F&}{\4c&H000000&}{\shad1}So they're-- They're together.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:15.30,1:06:18.34,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,泰莎\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs17}{\b0}{\c&HFFFFFF&}{\3c&H2F2F2F&}{\4c&H000000&}{\shad1}Oh, Tessa.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:20.64,1:06:24.07,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我知道待在裏德這樣的男孩子身邊的時間肯定很短暫\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs17}{\b0}{\c&HFFFFFF&}{\3c&H2F2F2F&}{\4c&H000000&}{\shad1}I know it must be a rush being around a guy like Reed.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:24.08,1:06:25.84,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我是說  他馬上就要成為巨星了\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs17}{\b0}{\c&HFFFFFF&}{\3c&H2F2F2F&}{\4c&H000000&}{\shad1}I mean, he's about to become a huge star--
Dialogue: 0,1:06:25.84,1:06:27.44,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,這個我一點都不在乎\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs17}{\b0}{\c&HFFFFFF&}{\3c&H2F2F2F&}{\4c&H000000&}{\shad1}I couldn't care less about that.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:27.45,1:06:32.28,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哈珀才是合適他的人\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs17}{\b0}{\c&HFFFFFF&}{\3c&H2F2F2F&}{\4c&H000000&}{\shad1}--which is exactly why Harper is so right for him.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:32.28,1:06:35.29,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,聽著  我不知道裏德跟你說了什麼\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs17}{\b0}{\c&HFFFFFF&}{\3c&H2F2F2F&}{\4c&H000000&}{\shad1}Look, I don't know what Reed told you,
Dialogue: 0,1:06:35.29,1:06:38.42,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但是我確信他月底就要求婚了\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs17}{\b0}{\c&HFFFFFF&}{\3c&H2F2F2F&}{\4c&H000000&}{\shad1}but I'm pretty sure he's gonna propose by the end of the month.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:38.42,1:06:39.86,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,什麼\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs17}{\b0}{\c&HFFFFFF&}{\3c&H2F2F2F&}{\4c&H000000&}{\shad1}What?
Dialogue: 0,1:06:41.33,1:06:43.83,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,很抱歉  泰莎  真的抱歉\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs17}{\b0}{\c&HFFFFFF&}{\3c&H2F2F2F&}{\4c&H000000&}{\shad1}I'm sorry, Tessa. Really.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:43.83,1:06:46.06,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,對不起\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs17}{\b0}{\c&HFFFFFF&}{\3c&H2F2F2F&}{\4c&H000000&}{\shad1}I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:51.70,1:06:54.10,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我怎麼這麼傻\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs17}{\b0}{\c&HFFFFFF&}{\3c&H2F2F2F&}{\4c&H000000&}{\shad1}How could I have been so stupid?
Dialogue: 0,1:06:54.11,1:06:57.94,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,結束了  我不演了\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs17}{\b0}{\c&HFFFFFF&}{\3c&H2F2F2F&}{\4c&H000000&}{\shad1}Well, I'm done. I'm done with the show.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:57.94,1:07:01.51,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我和裏德也算完了  也和貝拉·斯諾徹底說再見\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs17}{\b0}{\c&HFFFFFF&}{\3c&H2F2F2F&}{\4c&H000000&}{\shad1}I'm done with Reed. Definitely done with Bella Snow.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:01.51,1:07:05.02,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,演出不能沒有貝拉\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs17}{\b0}{\c&HFFFFFF&}{\3c&H2F2F2F&}{\4c&H000000&}{\shad1}The show can't go on without Bella.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:05.02,1:07:07.12,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他很聰明  能想到辦法的\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs17}{\b0}{\c&HFFFFFF&}{\3c&H2F2F2F&}{\4c&H000000&}{\shad1}He's resourceful. He'll figure something out.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:07.12,1:07:09.55,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,說曹操曹操到\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs17}{\b0}{\c&HFFFFFF&}{\3c&H2F2F2F&}{\4c&H000000&}{\shad1}Unh. Speaking of...
Dialogue: 0,1:07:11.02,1:07:13.39,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,聽著  事情的關鍵在你自己\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs17}{\b0}{\c&HFFFFFF&}{\3c&H2F2F2F&}{\4c&H000000&}{\shad1}Look, this is about you.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:13.39,1:07:16.26,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你假冒貝拉·斯諾  就是為了一個男孩子嗎\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs17}{\b0}{\c&HFFFFFF&}{\3c&H2F2F2F&}{\4c&H000000&}{\shad1}Did you become Bella Snow to win a boy?
Dialogue: 0,1:07:19.46,1:07:23.30,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不  不是  我假冒貝拉是因為我\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs17}{\b0}{\c&HFFFFFF&}{\3c&H2F2F2F&}{\4c&H000000&}{\shad1}No. No, I became Bella Snow because I was--
Dialogue: 0,1:07:23.30,1:07:25.20,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你在追逐自己的夢想\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs17}{\b0}{\c&HFFFFFF&}{\3c&H2F2F2F&}{\4c&H000000&}{\shad1}You were following your dream.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:26.87,1:07:30.67,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,弗雷迪點醒了我  喬吉\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs17}{\b0}{\c&HFFFFFF&}{\3c&H2F2F2F&}{\4c&H000000&}{\shad1}Freddie was a real wake-up call, Georgie.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:30.68,1:07:35.25,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我什麼都不是  也就會自欺欺人而已\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs17}{\b0}{\c&HFFFFFF&}{\3c&H2F2F2F&}{\4c&H000000&}{\shad1}I'm nobody. With just enough talent to delude myself.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:35.25,1:07:39.05,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,泰莎  你自己決定\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs17}{\b0}{\c&HFFFFFF&}{\3c&H2F2F2F&}{\4c&H000000&}{\shad1}Oh, Tessa, it's your decision.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:39.05,1:07:42.92,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但是你要是現在放棄了  直到你死的那一天\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs17}{\b0}{\c&HFFFFFF&}{\3c&H2F2F2F&}{\4c&H000000&}{\shad1}But if you give up now, you'll always wonder,
Dialogue: 0,1:07:42.92,1:07:47.26,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你都會想  我要是沒放棄會怎樣呢\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs17}{\b0}{\c&HFFFFFF&}{\3c&H2F2F2F&}{\4c&H000000&}{\shad1}to your dying day, what if?
Dialogue: 0,1:07:50.70,1:07:53.10,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,天啊  我好想你\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs17}{\b0}{\c&HFFFFFF&}{\3c&H2F2F2F&}{\4c&H000000&}{\shad1}God, I miss you.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:55.03,1:07:57.10,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你要是在這兒就好了  爸爸\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs17}{\b0}{\c&HFFFFFF&}{\3c&H2F2F2F&}{\4c&H000000&}{\shad1}I wish you were here, Dad.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:59.34,1:08:02.34,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,也不一定是指在這兒\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs17}{\b0}{\c&HFFFFFF&}{\3c&H2F2F2F&}{\4c&H000000&}{\shad1}Well, not exactly here.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:08.51,1:08:11.78,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你要是我  會怎麼做\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs17}{\b0}{\c&HFFFFFF&}{\3c&H2F2F2F&}{\4c&H000000&}{\shad1}What would you do if you were me?
Dialogue: 0,1:08:19.62,1:08:23.03,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我是這樣一個人\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs17}{\b0}{\c&HFFFFFF&}{\3c&H2F2F2F&}{\4c&H000000&}{\shad1}I've never been one
Dialogue: 0,1:08:23.03,1:08:28.13,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不曾踏出自己的舒適圈\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs17}{\b0}{\c&HFFFFFF&}{\3c&H2F2F2F&}{\4c&H000000&}{\shad1}To step out Of my comfort zone
Dialogue: 0,1:08:28.13,1:08:35.64,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,每次努力時  都擔心自己止步不前\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs17}{\b0}{\c&HFFFFFF&}{\3c&H2F2F2F&}{\4c&H000000&}{\shad1}Whenever I try I'm afraid to just let go
