Dialogue: 0,1:08:38.11,1:08:40.81,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我不知道我為什麼隱藏\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs17}{\b0}{\c&HFFFFFF&}{\3c&H2F2F2F&}{\4c&H000000&}{\shad1}Don't know why I hide
Dialogue: 0,1:08:40.81,1:08:44.98,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不讓他人知曉自己真實的內心\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs17}{\b0}{\c&HFFFFFF&}{\3c&H2F2F2F&}{\4c&H000000&}{\shad1}Never let them know What I feel inside
