Dialogue: 0,1:08:46.75,1:08:48.82,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,當我站立於此\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs17}{\b0}{\c&HFFFFFF&}{\3c&H2F2F2F&}{\4c&H000000&}{\shad1}Just to take a chance
Dialogue: 0,1:08:48.82,1:08:53.66,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,只能放手一搏\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs17}{\b0}{\c&HFFFFFF&}{\3c&H2F2F2F&}{\4c&H000000&}{\shad1}While I'm still standing here
Dialogue: 0,1:09:02.97,1:09:05.60,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我是這樣一個人\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs17}{\b0}{\c&HFFFFFF&}{\3c&H2F2F2F&}{\4c&H000000&}{\shad1}I've never been one
Dialogue: 0,1:09:05.60,1:09:09.97,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不曾掙脫束縛自由翱翔\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs17}{\b0}{\c&HFFFFFF&}{\3c&H2F2F2F&}{\4c&H000000&}{\shad1}To break free
