Dialogue: 0,1:21:52.04,1:21:54.27,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我有錯過試穿水晶鞋嗎\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs17}{\b0}{\c&HFFFFFF&}{\3c&H2F2F2F&}{\4c&H000000&}{\shad1}Am I too late to try on the slipper?
Dialogue: 0,1:21:54.27,1:21:56.67,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,泰莎\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs17}{\b0}{\c&HFFFFFF&}{\3c&H2F2F2F&}{\4c&H000000&}{\shad1}Tessa?
Dialogue: 0,1:21:58.41,1:21:59.84,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你是灰姑娘\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs17}{\b0}{\c&HFFFFFF&}{\3c&H2F2F2F&}{\4c&H000000&}{\shad1}You're Cinderella?
Dialogue: 0,1:22:02.08,1:22:04.61,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,抱歉  沒有告訴你我的真實身份\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs17}{\b0}{\c&HFFFFFF&}{\3c&H2F2F2F&}{\4c&H000000&}{\shad1}I'm sorry I didn't tell you who I really was.
