Dialogue: 0,1:22:18.90,1:22:20.33,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,有關婚禮的實情\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs17}{\b0}{\c&HFFFFFF&}{\3c&H2F2F2F&}{\4c&H000000&}{\shad1}of my impending nuptials.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:22.07,1:22:24.73,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,弗雷迪說我要和哈珀訂婚的事  是假的\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs17}{\b0}{\c&HFFFFFF&}{\3c&H2F2F2F&}{\4c&H000000&}{\shad1}Freddie totally lied about me getting married to Harper.
