Dialogue: 0,1:22:27.24,1:22:30.51,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,在這個王國  聲音能傳很遠\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs17}{\b0}{\c&HFFFFFF&}{\3c&H2F2F2F&}{\4c&H000000&}{\shad1}Sound travels quite well in this kingdom.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:31.98,1:22:34.91,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,請來試試水晶鞋吧\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs17}{\b0}{\c&HFFFFFF&}{\3c&H2F2F2F&}{\4c&H000000&}{\shad1}Please, try on the glass slipper.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:34.91,1:22:37.08,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,樂意之至\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs17}{\b0}{\c&HFFFFFF&}{\3c&H2F2F2F&}{\4c&H000000&}{\shad1}I'd love to.
