Dialogue: 0,1:22:55.17,1:22:58.43,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你就是我的命中注定\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs17}{\b0}{\c&HFFFFFF&}{\3c&H2F2F2F&}{\4c&H000000&}{\shad1}You're the one.
